  data: {
    LLM: "Player to dealer's left leads to first trick. Must follow suit if possible. Amsterdam rules: If cannot follow and opponent is winning, must beat with trump if possible. If partner is winning, may play any card (except cannot undertrump). Rotterdam rules: Must always play trump if cannot follow suit; must beat any trumps already played if possible.",
    Player: "Player to dealer's left leads to first trick. Must follow suit if possible. Amsterdam rules: If cannot follow and opponent is winning, must beat with trump if possible. If partner is winning, may play any card (except cannot undertrump). Rotterdam rules: Must always play trump if cannot follow suit; must beat any trumps already played if possible.",
    objective: 'Score as many points as possible over 16 hands. In each hand, the team that chooses trumps must collect more than half the available points (81+ out of 162). If they fail, the opposing team gets all the points.',
